    refine GlobalTheory.UPoinc.DeepSame.deep_eq_of_congMod E H Dw hpq l Xo cf C X₁ D p z₁ z₂ hz₂ f t hfO hfapp w₁ w₂ htie hproj (ct₂ y₀) (yy y₀) (hyy₂ y₀) _ _ _ _
